  "description": "Halva (Χαλβάς in Greek) is a small .NET 8+ library that implements Google's Brotli compression, alognside some encryption options. The Halva package is a general purpose game data packaging system that provides good and fast compression, making it suitable for storing the game files with the game, releasing patches, etc.",
